The current comment states that in Node versions >=20.1, `Dirent.path` was renamed to `parentPath`, but I think this could be inaccurate. In reality, Node 24 only includes `parentPath`, and `path` was present in 20.11.1. It seems like the check for recursive support may start from version 18.17.0. I need to be precise in my report. I might characterize the comment as a note rather than a blocker since it has some inaccuracies but no real functional concerns. It’s essential to manually check line numbers as well."}]}

